  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Your daily runs just became more enjoyable! Introducing the Nike Vomero Plus—everyday runners that take maximum cushioning to the next level. Featuring a mountainous stack of full-length ZoomX foam, the most responsive foam in the industry, these ultra-light sneakers let you zoom past your running goals in absolute comfort. The high-abrasion rubber outsole offers a firm grip, delivering the optimum traction required for a safe and effective run. It’s time to go the extra mile and redefine your limits with the Nike Vomero Plus!</p> <p><strong>Nike Vomero Plus features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper offers soft breathability.</li> <li>Webbed lace loops provide an adjustable fit.</li> <li>Reflective hits along the toe and heel improve low-light visibility.</li> <li>Weight: Approximately 9.5 oz.</li> <li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero Plus - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Bright Crimson/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 